  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The reference DICOM-to-NIfTI converter for neuroimaging — embedded in 100+ downstream tools including fMRIprep, FreeSurfer, SPM12, AFNI, and heudiconv. BSD-2-Clause, actively maintained by Chris Rorden's lab with frequent releases (v1.0.20260416, May 2026), 1.2k stars. Handles vendor-specific DICOM divergences across all major scanner manufacturers. No credible open-source alternative at this level of adoption, reliability, and breadth of scanner support. The starting point for any neuroimaging data pipeline.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-22",
